{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Harvest Planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the calm moments between alien waves to land on planets, gather vital resources, and prepare for the next fight.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.poster.avif?t=1770571008\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.webm?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/ad0c1e7585f9e53c64a474abfb1af5ae.mp4?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run generates a brand-new universe filled with unique planets, wandering merchants, cosmic anomalies, and unexpected discoveries as you travel through space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/673e72cb30ac6bf88138b35b72a8a57f.poster.avif?t=1770571008\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/673e72cb30ac6bf88138b35b72a8a57f.webm?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/673e72cb30ac6bf88138b35b72a8a57f.mp4?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight colorful waves of aliens </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter diverse alien species as you explore the universe. Tight movement, smart skill use, and solid preparation are essential as enemies grow stronger each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/e5b39bc7ee7489b6356d9a80c3b37002.poster.avif?t=1770571008\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/e5b39bc7ee7489b6356d9a80c3b37002.webm?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/e5b39bc7ee7489b6356d9a80c3b37002.mp4?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Build your way to victory </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your spaceship and combine artifacts, talents, items and relics to forge unique builds. Experiment with countless synergies and unleash your own playstyle in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94fde4f5fb53927596e1c946a83e151e.poster.avif?t=1770571008\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94fde4f5fb53927596e1c946a83e151e.webm?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94fde4f5fb53927596e1c946a83e151e.mp4?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94c4b3e21e6e7d595e3a0e38e5b62010.poster.avif?t=1770571008\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94c4b3e21e6e7d595e3a0e38e5b62010.webm?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2352670/extras/94c4b3e21e6e7d595e3a0e38e5b62010.mp4?t=1770571008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Endless replayability</strong>: A procedurally generated universe that offers limitless exploration with planets, stars and cosmic wonders, setting it apart from traditional static or repetitive maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countless builds</strong>: Hundreds of different abilities obtainable through talents, items, artifacts, and relics, that can completely shift the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strategic gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Between alien waves, harvest resources from nearby planets and interact with the universe to prepare your next move. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Quick play sessions:</strong>\u00a0Play in short bursts and pick up right where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>And more:\u00a0</strong>Missions, unlockables, secrets, and surprises await. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Depth I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2352670/a3aa8516da445c00cc570c84664cb96a3cabb1ec.jpg"},{"name":"Depth II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2352670/542bf13a8b00b50735aa4fac18bdbc9db1703eae.jpg"},{"name":"Depth III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2352670/406a33ce7677b68419655183bf4e5540661b2dfc.jpg"},{"name":"Geometric Relics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2352670/cea424d52300aa35e9863b3911e81d0d8806444c.jpg"},{"name":"Cosmic Ring Overload","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2352670/27d358d00456ff722a01bc4dcabe6544f2c04bdf.jpg"},{"name":"Alien Bane"